Transitioning menu to another version of menu when scrolling down a web page is a common technique called a "menu toggle" or "menu reveal". Here's a step-by-step guide to achieve this:

**HTML Structure**

First, you need to create the basic HTML structure for your menu. For simplicity, let's assume you have a main menu with two sections: primary menu (default) and secondary menu (revealed when scrolled down).

```html
<nav>
  <!-- Primary Menu (default) -->
  <ul id="primary-menu">
    <li><a href="#">Menu Item 1</a></li>
    <li><a href="#">Menu Item 2</a></li>
  </ul>

  <!-- Secondary Menu (revealed when scrolled down) -->
  <ul id="secondary-menu" style="display: none;">
    <li><a href="#">Secondary Menu Item 1</a></li>
    <li><a href="#">Secondary Menu Item 2</a></li>
  </ul>
</nav>
```

**CSS**

To achieve the menu transition, you'll add some CSS code. We'll add a simple animation to reveal the secondary menu when the user scrolls down.

```css
/* Style the primary menu */
#primary-menu {
  list-style: none;
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
  background-color: #333;
  color: #fff;
  text-align: center;
  padding: 1rem;
}

/* Style the secondary menu */
#secondary-menu {
  list-style: none;
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
  background-color: #333;
  color: #fff;
  text-align: center;
  padding: 1rem;
  transition: opacity 0.5s ease-in-out; /* add transition for animating opacity */
}

/* Hide the secondary menu initially */
#secondary-menu {
  opacity: 0;
  pointer-events: none; /* disable pointer events to prevent clicking on the hidden menu */
}

/* Add an event listener to detect when the user scrolls down */
window.addEventListener("scroll", function() {
  const secondaryMenu = document.getElementById("secondary-menu");
  const primaryMenu = document.getElementById("primary-menu");
  const scrollPosition = window.scrollY;

  if (scrollPosition > primaryMenu.offsetHeight) {
    secondaryMenu.style.opacity = "1";
    secondaryMenu.style.pointerEvents = "auto"; /* enable pointer events when the secondary menu is revealed */
  }
});
```

